      "x": 830,
      "y": 596,
      "width": 255,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "check_scope.py → enforce scope.json\ncheck_py.py → ruff check on .py\ncheck_ts.py → tsc --noEmit on .tsx\ncheck_tests.py → run matching tests\ncheck_phase.py → block if wrong phase\nsave_compact.py → persist compacts",
