    {
      "id": "legend-details",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 245,
      "height": 330,
      "text": ".claude/phase.json tracks:\n  { phase, task }\n\nPhase transitions:\n  plan → design → build →\n  rr → qa-expert →\n  qa-reviewer → sync →\n  done → cc\n\nFail paths (back to build):\n  rr FAIL → build\n  qa-expert NO-GO → build\n  qa-reviewer NO-GO → build\n\nSession hooks:\n  check_session_start.py\n    → loads rules + phase\n  check_stop.py\n    → shows phase on exit\n\nScope enforcement:\n  .claude/scope.json\n    → declared in /scope-contract\n    → enforced by check_scope.py",
